# A walnut chimney breast with a gilt portrait, a mantel with a candle and a
# carriage clock, and a stone firebox with a live fire. Two tiles wide; covers
# a back wall face. The flames loop and the embers twinkle. Switched off
# (frame off), the fire is out and the candle unlit.
